  "notes": "INSTALLER PAGE, captured with the image's ENTRYPOINT DELIBERATELY BYPASSED. The joomla entrypoint runs makedb.php first and refuses to hand over to Apache until a MySQL server answers, so the stock `docker run joomla:5.0.2-apache` exits before serving anything and a database sidecar would be the only alternative. The cmd below does exactly what the entrypoint does for the web root -- copies /usr/src/joomla verbatim into /var/www/html -- and then starts Apache, so the page captured is the unmodified Joomla 5.0.2 installer as shipped in the image. Nothing about the served files is synthesised; only the database wait is skipped.",
